boss for the feedback.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Feedback</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Thanking for Feedback</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you want to review my project?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thank you for your feedback. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I finished the assignment.  Would you like to review it?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I appreciate your understanding. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you have any comments on my performance?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That is very useful for me. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where do you think I need to improve?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will remember that next time.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to finish ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to complete ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter, did you finish the report?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk to your boss.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "assignment ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a written task for work or school ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I completed the assignment. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to discuss ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to talk about something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Let's discuss the issue now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to improve ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something better ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could you share your ideas on how to improve the program?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to run out of ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not have enough of something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My printer ran out of paper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "improvement ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making something better ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I asked Peter to suggest improvements to the internship program.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "began ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "past tense of verb to begin ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I only began this job yesterday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "report ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I asked Peter to prepare a report on his new responsibilities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "internship ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "work experience related to studies, for little or no payment ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you suggest any improvements to the internship program?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le07ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write 5 - 8 things to say in a meeting. Write each sentence on a separate piece of paper. Use the past tense. (Example: <span class=\"italic\">I didn't complete the assignment.</span>)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner is the boss. Read each sentence and explain the situation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your boss gives you feedback.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Thank your boss for the feedback.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify situations for a meeting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain the situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for and give feedback.", "type": "text"}]}]}